    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "004d7d9f2849e0ec2748": "Train me.",
        "1339d0e41dc8c7090293": "Come back to me when you've had more training. Randal Worth over there can help you with that.",
        "161e3a9c52ed1d2c0c8d": "Sorry, but you've reached the limit of what I can teach. If you want to learn more, go see Telonis in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. He's pretty talented, so I hear.",
        "4df6a56f39246e74b8a2": "Randal's a bit of a dandy, but he's dependable, which is more than I can say for a lot of the students I take on. Still, I guess I can't blame them for wanting a bit of adventure.",
        "8088d0f64be8dd9464e1": "Hmm, I guess I can take on another student. Well, don't just stand there. Tell me what you're looking to learn."
      },
      "name": "Simon Tanner",
      "subName": "Expert Leatherworker",
